llama-jni — third-party notices
===============================

llama-jni binds llama.cpp and ggml. It vendors the llama.cpp / ggml C headers of release b11195
(src/main/c/include/) and its build downloads the unmodified b11195 release libraries (libllama,
libggml*). Both are distributed under the MIT License:

